Package: snail
Title: Visualise Weather Forecast
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lassi", "Myllykoski", , "lassi.myllykoski@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
  Fetch hourly weather forecast from Norwegian Meteorological Institute's database
  and visualise essential weather properties like temperature, rain probability,
  cloudiness and others in a ggplot.
